Experiment C -- coverage-illusion control: is C-methylation burden enriched PAST the
reachability boundary, at matched carbon count? (survivorship test of the Gate-3 frontier)
============================================================================================
H = C-methyl BRANCH count on the deposited structure (upper bound for true C-MeT);
primary axis controlled for carbon count C. Reachable(9) vs CHO-in-scope-unreachable(205);
112 heteroatom cores reported separately. Citrinin = pre-named high-H/unreachable control.

