[2] POSITIVE CONTROL -- citrinin (BGC0001338) must be high-H (>=2) AND unreachable
    citrinin: H=3  C=13  status=unreachable  -> PASS (high-H, past boundary)

[3] PRIMARY -- reachable vs CHO-in-scope-unreachable, controlling for carbon count
    n: reachable=9  cho-unreachable=205
    carbon range: reachable C[8,12]  cho C[7,41]  (severe size confound -> control mandatory)

    RAW (uncontrolled -- expected to be confounded by size):
      reachable    meanH=0.778  P(H>=1)=0.778  P(H>=2)=0.000
      cho-unreach  meanH=2.278  P(H>=1)=0.815  P(H>=2)=0.546

